    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "id": "o2NUZ",
      "x": 4845,
      "y": 46,
      "width": 721,
      "height": 397,
      "content": "create a graph of tags and artifacts Node ID: bRnPz\n\nSigma.js + graphology\nYour graph is very large (10k+ nodes). It’s the fastest WebGL option and graphology has layout and community-detection algorithms (useful for coloring clusters like Obsidian’s groups). More setup than react-force-graph.\n\nreview filters"
    }
